{"zh":[{"start":0.02,"end":4.03,"text":"旁白："},{"start":4.05,"end":8.04,"text":"从地面看，节日灯光让我们开心，帮我们庆祝节日。"},{"start":8.06,"end":12.07,"text":"但从太空长期观察，它们能告诉我们一些关于文化"},{"start":12.09,"end":16.15,"text":"和能源使用的信息。三年前，"},{"start":16.17,"end":20.17,"text":"一颗名叫 Suomi NPP 的新卫星开始给我们带来地球的壮观新景象，"},{"start":20.19,"end":24.19,"text":"白天和夜晚都有。不过，虽然看到"},{"start":24.21,"end":28.29,"text":"整个地球灯火通明令人惊叹，这仍只是一张合成图，"},{"start":28.31,"end":32.31,"text":"把几个月的观测平均起来。从太空"},{"start":32.33,"end":36.37,"text":"看到全貌总是有帮助的，但我们能了解更多，"},{"start":36.39,"end":40.4,"text":"如果能看到这幅画面随时间变化。"},{"start":40.42,"end":44.47,"text":"一个由 NASA 领导的研究团队一直在仔细研究 NPP 的数据，"},{"start":44.49,"end":48.49,"text":"并校正月光反射等因素，以及"},{"start":48.51,"end":52.51,"text":"地形、云、气溶胶的影响，做出一个有科学价值的"},{"start":52.53,"end":56.53,"text":"每天测量地球灯光的产品。"},{"start":56.55,"end":60.56,"text":"他们在数据里注意到的第一件事是节假日的影响。"},{"start":60.58,"end":64.58,"text":"罗曼：我们开始看夜间数据的时候，"},{"start":64.6,"end":68.61,"text":"本以为夜间灯光会非常稳定。"},{"start":68.63,"end":72.67,"text":"结果我们非常惊讶地看到明显的增长，"},{"start":72.69,"end":76.7,"text":"节假日期间活动增多，尤其是"},{"start":76.72,"end":80.73,"text":"郊区一带。那里有很多独栋住宅，"},{"start":80.75,"end":84.74,"text":"有很大的院子可以挂灯。"},{"start":84.76,"end":88.78,"text":"旁白：把感恩节到新年之间的六周和一年其他时间相比，"},{"start":88.8,"end":92.87,"text":"团队发现大片地区的夜间灯光亮了 20%、30%，甚至 50%，"},{"start":92.89,"end":96.88,"text":"节日期间更亮，这里用绿色表示。"},{"start":96.9,"end":100.9,"text":"罗曼：所以我们看到的是活动地点的转移，"},{"start":100.92,"end":104.92,"text":"人们待在家里"},{"start":104.94,"end":108.97,"text":"庆祝，或者去乡村"},{"start":108.99,"end":113.08,"text":"庆祝……他们打开灯"},{"start":113.1,"end":117.11,"text":"。而在市中心，人们关了灯，因为他们出去过节了。"},{"start":117.13,"end":121.14,"text":"旁白："},{"start":121.16,"end":125.21,"text":"研究人员其实最早是在中东的斋月期间看到节日灯光模式变化的。"},{"start":125.23,"end":129.29,"text":"罗曼：和西方的圣诞节、新年不同，斋月期间"},{"start":129.31,"end":133.3,"text":"你看不到活动地点的转移。你看到的是社区"},{"start":133.32,"end":137.33,"text":"待在原地，只是把活动"},{"start":137.35,"end":141.37,"text":"转到夜里。"},{"start":141.39,"end":145.39,"text":"这些测量告诉我们的另一件事是，它甚至能捕捉到文化差异，"},{"start":145.41,"end":149.41,"text":"即使在同一个群体里，比如穆斯林群体"},{"start":149.43,"end":153.43,"text":"在斋月期间。我们看到行为模式"},{"start":153.45,"end":157.51,"text":"在不同国家差别很大，"},{"start":157.53,"end":161.55,"text":"土耳其夜间灯光增加较少，夜间灯光大幅增加的是"},{"start":161.57,"end":165.57,"text":"沙特阿拉伯，以色列夜间灯光没有增加，"},{"start":165.59,"end":169.61,"text":"因为它不是以穆斯林为主的国家。所以数据里能看到很多多样性。"},{"start":169.63,"end":173.65,"text":"旁白：因为夜间灯光数据分辨率很高，"},{"start":173.67,"end":177.66,"text":"耶鲁大学的研究人员甚至在研究"},{"start":177.68,"end":181.69,"text":"城市里的街区，并把数据和已知的政治、"},{"start":181.71,"end":185.72,"text":"社会经济因素联系起来。"},{"start":185.74,"end":189.78,"text":"但从 NASA 的角度看，为什么要专注于从太空看地球的灯光？"},{"start":189.8,"end":193.8,"text":"罗曼：我们很多能力都集中在"},{"start":193.82,"end":197.82,"text":"用卫星获取全球图景，看看我们"},{"start":197.84,"end":201.85,"text":"在环境方面、在日常过程方面"},{"start":201.87,"end":205.9,"text":"处于什么位置——驱动地球系统的过程。其中很重要的一部分就是"},{"start":205.92,"end":209.92,"text":"人类活动，以及人类如何驱动各种过程，"},{"start":209.94,"end":213.96,"text":"影响地球，比如碳排放，"},{"start":213.98,"end":218.01,"text":"比如城市各处的发热模式。"},{"start":218.03,"end":222.04,"text":"所以通过看灯光，我们能看到人类行为的变化，"},{"start":222.06,"end":226.08,"text":"随季节变化、随每天变化，我们还能用"},{"start":226.1,"end":230.12,"text":"这些信息去理解是什么"},{"start":230.14,"end":234.15,"text":"常态在驱动背后的"},{"start":234.17,"end":238.19,"text":"能源决策。如果你看气候变化"},{"start":238.21,"end":242.24,"text":"研究，现在我们知道超过 70% 的排放"},{"start":242.26,"end":246.27,"text":"发生在城市。所以 NASA 非常重视"},{"start":246.29,"end":250.31,"text":"理解城市，理解"},{"start":250.33,"end":254.36,"text":"城市如何与气候和整个系统相互作用的动态。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.02,"end":4.03,"text":"Narrator:","words":[["Narrator:","旁白："]]},{"start":4.05,"end":8.04,"text":"When seen from the ground holiday lights give us cheer and help us celebrate the season.","words":[["When","当"],["seen","看"],["from","从"],["the","这"],["ground","地面"],["holiday","节日"],["lights","灯光"],["give","给"],["us","我们"],["cheer","欢乐"],["and","和"],["help","帮"],["us","我们"],["celebrate","庆祝"],["the","这"],["season.","季节。"]]},{"start":8.06,"end":12.07,"text":"But from space, over time, they can tell us something about both culture","words":[["But","但"],["from","从"],["space,","太空，"],["over","随着"],["time,","时间，"],["they","它们"],["can","能"],["tell","告诉"],["us","我们"],["something","一些"],["about","关于"],["both","两者"],["culture","文化"]]},{"start":12.09,"end":16.15,"text":"and energy usage. Three years ago","words":[["and","和"],["energy","能源"],["usage.","使用。"],["Three","三"],["years","年"],["ago","前"]]},{"start":16.17,"end":20.17,"text":"a new satellite called Suomi NPP began to give us brilliant new views of the Earth","words":[["a","一颗"],["new","新"],["satellite","卫星"],["called","叫做"],["Suomi","Suomi"],["NPP","NPP"],["began","开始"],["to","去"],["give","给"],["us","我们"],["brilliant","壮观的"],["new","新"],["views","景象"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["Earth","地球"]]},{"start":20.19,"end":24.19,"text":"by day and by night. But as stunning as it is","words":[["by","在"],["day","白天"],["and","和"],["by","在"],["night.","夜晚。"],["But","但"],["as","尽管"],["stunning","惊艳"],["as","如同"],["it","它"],["is","是"]]},{"start":24.21,"end":28.29,"text":"to see Earth all aglow, this is still just one composite image","words":[["to","去"],["see","看"],["Earth","地球"],["all","全部"],["aglow,","发光，"],["this","这"],["is","是"],["still","仍"],["just","只"],["one","一张"],["composite","合成"],["image","图像"]]},{"start":28.31,"end":32.31,"text":"averaging observations over a period of months. Getting the","words":[["averaging","平均"],["observations","观测"],["over","在"],["a","一段"],["period","时期"],["of","的"],["months.","几个月。"],["Getting","获得"],["the","这"]]},{"start":32.33,"end":36.37,"text":"big picture from space is always helpful, but we can learn even more","words":[["big","全"],["picture","貌"],["from","从"],["space","太空"],["is","是"],["always","总是"],["helpful,","有帮助，"],["but","但"],["we","我们"],["can","能"],["learn","了解"],["even","甚至"],["more","更多"]]},{"start":36.39,"end":40.4,"text":"seeing that picture change over time.","words":[["seeing","看到"],["that","那"],["picture","画面"],["change","变化"],["over","随着"],["time.","时间。"]]},{"start":40.42,"end":44.47,"text":"A NASA-lead team of researchers has been pouring over the data from NPP","words":[["A","一个"],["NASA-lead","NASA领导的"],["team","团队"],["of","的"],["researchers","研究人员"],["has","一直"],["been","在"],["pouring","仔细"],["over","研究"],["the","这"],["data","数据"],["from","来自"],["NPP","NPP"]]},{"start":44.49,"end":48.49,"text":"and compensating for factors like the reflection of the moon and the effect","words":[["and","和"],["compensating","校正"],["for","对"],["factors","因素"],["like","像"],["the","这"],["reflection","反射"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["moon","月亮"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["effect","影响"]]},{"start":48.51,"end":52.51,"text":"terrain, clouds, aerosols, to produce a scientifically-valuable","words":[["terrain,","地形，"],["clouds,","云，"],["aerosols,","气溶胶，"],["to","去"],["produce","做出"],["a","一个"],["scientifically-valuable","有科学价值的"]]},{"start":52.53,"end":56.53,"text":"measuring Earth’s lights on a daily basis.","words":[["measuring","测量"],["Earth’s","地球的"],["lights","灯光"],["on","在"],["a","一个"],["daily","每日"],["basis.","基础。"]]},{"start":56.55,"end":60.56,"text":"The first thing they noticed in the data was the effect of holidays.","words":[["The","这"],["first","第一"],["thing","件事"],["they","他们"],["noticed","注意到"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["data","数据"],["was","是"],["the","这"],["effect","影响"],["of","的"],["holidays.","节假日。"]]},{"start":60.58,"end":64.58,"text":"Román:When we started looking at the data at night over the","words":[["Román:When","罗曼：当"],["we","我们"],["started","开始"],["looking","看"],["at","在"],["the","这"],["data","数据"],["at","在"],["night","夜间"],["over","在"],["the","这"]]},{"start":64.6,"end":68.61,"text":"we were expecting to see a lot of stability in the night time lights.","words":[["we","我们"],["were","当时"],["expecting","预计"],["to","去"],["see","看到"],["a","一个"],["lot","很多"],["of","的"],["stability","稳定"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["night","夜间"],["time","时"],["lights.","灯光。"]]},{"start":68.63,"end":72.67,"text":"And we were really surprised to see this really vibrant increase","words":[["And","而"],["we","我们"],["were","当时"],["really","真的"],["surprised","惊讶"],["to","去"],["see","看到"],["this","这个"],["really","真的"],["vibrant","明显的"],["increase","增长"]]},{"start":72.69,"end":76.7,"text":"in activity during the holidays particularly around","words":[["in","在"],["activity","活动"],["during","期间"],["the","这"],["holidays","节假日"],["particularly","尤其"],["around","周围"]]},{"start":76.72,"end":80.73,"text":"areas in the suburbs.You have a lot of single-family homes","words":[["areas","地区"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["suburbs.You","郊区。你"],["have","有"],["a","一个"],["lot","很多"],["of","的"],["single-family","独栋"],["homes","住宅"]]},{"start":80.75,"end":84.74,"text":"with a lot of yard space to put in lights.","words":[["with","带"],["a","一个"],["lot","很多"],["of","的"],["yard","院子"],["space","空间"],["to","去"],["put","挂"],["in","进"],["lights.","灯。"]]},{"start":84.76,"end":88.78,"text":"Narrator:Comparing the six weeks between Thanksgiving and New Years to the rest of the year,","words":[["Narrator:Comparing","旁白：比较"],["the","这"],["six","六"],["weeks","周"],["between","之间"],["Thanksgiving","感恩节"],["and","和"],["New","新"],["Years","年"],["to","对"],["the","这"],["rest","其余"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["year,","年，"]]},{"start":88.8,"end":92.87,"text":"the team noticed large areas where night lights were 20, 30, even 50 percent","words":[["the","这"],["team","团队"],["noticed","注意到"],["large","大"],["areas","地区"],["where","那里"],["night","夜间"],["lights","灯光"],["were","是"],["20,","20，"],["30,","30，"],["even","甚至"],["50","50"],["percent","百分"]]},{"start":92.89,"end":96.88,"text":"brighter over the holidays, as shown here in shades of green.","words":[["brighter","更亮"],["over","在"],["the","这"],["holidays,","节假日，"],["as","如"],["shown","显示"],["here","这里"],["in","在"],["shades","色调"],["of","的"],["green.","绿色。"]]},{"start":96.9,"end":100.9,"text":"Román:And so what we are seeing is this shift in location","words":[["Román:And","罗曼：所以"],["so","所以"],["what","什么"],["we","我们"],["are","是"],["seeing","看到"],["is","是"],["this","这个"],["shift","转移"],["in","在"],["location","地点"]]},{"start":100.92,"end":104.92,"text":"in activity where people are staying in their homes","words":[["in","在"],["activity","活动"],["where","那里"],["people","人们"],["are","是"],["staying","待"],["in","在"],["their","他们的"],["homes","家里"]]},{"start":104.94,"end":108.97,"text":"and they’re celebrating, or they’re traveling to the rural areas","words":[["and","和"],["they’re","他们在"],["celebrating,","庆祝，"],["or","或"],["they’re","他们在"],["traveling","去"],["to","到"],["the","这"],["rural","乡村"],["areas","地区"]]},{"start":108.99,"end":113.08,"text":"and they’re celebrating … and they’re turning on the lights","words":[["and","和"],["they’re","他们在"],["celebrating","庆祝"],["…","…"],["and","和"],["they’re","他们在"],["turning","打开"],["on","开"],["the","这"],["lights","灯"]]},{"start":113.1,"end":117.11,"text":". Whereas in the urban centers people are turning off the lights because they’re going off for the holidays.","words":[[".","。"],["Whereas","而"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["urban","城市"],["centers","中心"],["people","人们"],["are","是"],["turning","关"],["off","掉"],["the","这"],["lights","灯"],["because","因为"],["they’re","他们在"],["going","出"],["off","去"],["for","为了"],["the","这"],["holidays.","节假日。"]]},{"start":117.13,"end":121.14,"text":"Narrator:","words":[["Narrator:","旁白："]]},{"start":121.16,"end":125.21,"text":"Researchers actually first saw changes in holiday lighting patterns during Ramadan in the Middle East.","words":[["Researchers","研究人员"],["actually","其实"],["first","最早"],["saw","看到"],["changes","变化"],["in","在"],["holiday","节日"],["lighting","灯光"],["patterns","模式"],["during","期间"],["Ramadan","斋月"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Middle","中"],["East.","东。"]]},{"start":125.23,"end":129.29,"text":"Román:In contrast to the western holidays of Christmas and New Years, during Ramadan","words":[["Román:In","罗曼：在"],["contrast","对比"],["to","对"],["the","这"],["western","西方"],["holidays","节日"],["of","的"],["Christmas","圣诞节"],["and","和"],["New","新"],["Years,","年，"],["during","期间"],["Ramadan","斋月"]]},{"start":129.31,"end":133.3,"text":"you don’t see a shift in activity in location. What you’re seeing is that communities","words":[["you","你"],["don’t","不"],["see","看到"],["a","一个"],["shift","转移"],["in","在"],["activity","活动"],["in","在"],["location.","地点。"],["What","什么"],["you’re","你在"],["seeing","看到"],["is","是"],["that","那"],["communities","社区"]]},{"start":133.32,"end":137.33,"text":"are staying where they are, and they’re shifting their activities","words":[["are","是"],["staying","待"],["where","那里"],["they","他们"],["are,","在，"],["and","和"],["they’re","他们在"],["shifting","转移"],["their","他们的"],["activities","活动"]]},{"start":137.35,"end":141.37,"text":"to the nighttime.","words":[["to","到"],["the","这"],["nighttime.","夜间。"]]},{"start":141.39,"end":145.39,"text":"Another thing that the … measurements are telling us is that it’s capturing cultural differences even","words":[["Another","另一"],["thing","件事"],["that","那"],["the","这"],["…","…"],["measurements","测量"],["are","是"],["telling","告诉"],["us","我们"],["is","是"],["that","那"],["it’s","它在"],["capturing","捕捉"],["cultural","文化"],["differences","差异"],["even","甚至"]]},{"start":145.41,"end":149.41,"text":"within a single community like the Muslim community","words":[["within","在"],["a","一个"],["single","单一"],["community","群体"],["like","像"],["the","这"],["Muslim","穆斯林"],["community","群体"]]},{"start":149.43,"end":153.43,"text":"during the month of Ramadan. We’re seeing patterns in behavior","words":[["during","期间"],["the","这"],["month","月"],["of","的"],["Ramadan.","斋月。"],["We’re","我们在"],["seeing","看到"],["patterns","模式"],["in","在"],["behavior","行为"]]},{"start":153.45,"end":157.51,"text":"that varies significantly from country to country,","words":[["that","那"],["varies","差别"],["significantly","显著地"],["from","从"],["country","国家"],["to","到"],["country,","国家，"]]},{"start":157.53,"end":161.55,"text":"a smaller increase in nighttime lights in Turkey, large increase of nighttime lights in","words":[["a","一个"],["smaller","较小"],["increase","增加"],["in","在"],["nighttime","夜间"],["lights","灯光"],["in","在"],["Turkey,","土耳其，"],["large","大"],["increase","增加"],["of","的"],["nighttime","夜间"],["lights","灯光"],["in","在"]]},{"start":161.57,"end":165.57,"text":"Saudi Arabia, no increase in nighttime lights in Israel","words":[["Saudi","沙特"],["Arabia,","阿拉伯，"],["no","没有"],["increase","增加"],["in","在"],["nighttime","夜间"],["lights","灯光"],["in","在"],["Israel","以色列"]]},{"start":165.59,"end":169.61,"text":"because it’s not a predominantly Muslim country. So it’s a lot of diversity seen within the data.","words":[["because","因为"],["it’s","它是"],["not","不"],["a","一个"],["predominantly","主要"],["Muslim","穆斯林"],["country.","国家。"],["So","所以"],["it’s","它是"],["a","一个"],["lot","很多"],["of","的"],["diversity","多样性"],["seen","看到"],["within","在"],["the","这"],["data.","数据。"]]},{"start":169.63,"end":173.65,"text":"Narrator:Because the night light data has such good resolution,","words":[["Narrator:Because","旁白：因为"],["the","这"],["night","夜间"],["light","灯光"],["data","数据"],["has","有"],["such","如此"],["good","好的"],["resolution,","分辨率，"]]},{"start":173.67,"end":177.66,"text":"researchers from Yale University have even been looking at","words":[["researchers","研究人员"],["from","来自"],["Yale","耶鲁"],["University","大学"],["have","已经"],["even","甚至"],["been","一直"],["looking","在"],["at","研究"]]},{"start":177.68,"end":181.69,"text":"neighborhoods within cities, and correlating that data with known political and","words":[["neighborhoods","街区"],["within","在"],["cities,","城市，"],["and","和"],["correlating","关联"],["that","那"],["data","数据"],["with","与"],["known","已知的"],["political","政治"],["and","和"]]},{"start":181.71,"end":185.72,"text":"socio-economic factors.","words":[["socio-economic","社会经济"],["factors.","因素。"]]},{"start":185.74,"end":189.78,"text":"But from a NASA perspective, why is it important to concentrate on Earth’s lights from space?","wor